d the task warns about).\n- **step_04 / step_06**: Structure of two of those triangles: 64\u2013102\u20131152 (embedded in a hub-158 star region) and 23\u2013270\u20131823.\n- **step_05 / step_07**: The three events touching {102,1152} (i.e. the full 64\u2013102\u20131152 triangle) fall in [23803,24053], [24303,24553], [24553,24803] \u2014 the last two events are within <500 units, so that one triangle *is* a prompt closure.\n- **step_08**: The 23\u2013270\u20131823 triangle's events are scattered across [27553,28553], [30553,31553], [31553,32553], [33553,34553] \u2014 supporting and closing edges separated by thousands of units, far beyond the 800-unit criterion. No prompt closure there.\n\n**Conclusion**: static triangles exist for every listed node, but temporally only a single isolated triple (64/102/1152) closes promptly; the other inspected triple closes only after ~3\u20136k units. One coincidental fast triangle in a 1700-event, near-zero-repeat sparse window is not a coordinated closure wave.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_00eaa1bc\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"closure_wave\",\n  \"entities\": [18, 23, 26, 35, 42, 62, 64, 68, 80, 98, 102, 149],\n  \"window\": [22553, 34553],\n  \"confidence\": 0.58,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"support\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"Every target node sits in exactly one static triangle (step_03), so static connectivity is present, but the timing is not wave-like. The 23-270-1823 triangle's edges are spread over 27.5k-34.5k, thousands of units a